	"icon": "tfg:textures/item/cassava_product.png",
	"pages": [
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"title": "幽冥之地作物",
			"text": "$(thing)幽冥之地$()环境或许恶劣，但依然能在那里找到农作物。幽冥之地的作物具有极强的生命力，能在极端高温条件下生长，这使它们在地下和地表生存中发挥重要作用。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "Crops in the beneath behave just the same as crops on the surface; they have hydration, temperature, and nutrient requirements. You can even plant them in $(thing)Greenhouses.$()$(br2)An important concern when planting crops in the Beneath is that crops require a light level of 12, which isn't provided by the Beneath's natural light. To solve this problem, you can utilize $(l:agriculture/aqueducts)Lava Aqueducts$() or any other available light source."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"title": "目录",
			"text": "$(li)$(l:beneath/beneath_crops#cassava)Cassava$()$(li)$(l:beneath/beneath_crops#peanut)Peanut$()$(li)$(l:beneath/beneath_crops#beans)Blackstone Beans$()$(li)$(l:beneath/beneath_crops#ghost_pepper)Ghost Pepper$()$(li)$(l:beneath/beneath_crops#cotton)Cotton$()"
		},
